# Pulse Chat / Agent mode contract (ADR-0046 · RULE_35 · G2)

## Hard contract

| Mode | Allowed | Forbidden |
|------|---------|-----------|
| **Chat** | Reads, advice, drafts, clarify, memory confirm (`learn_fact`) | Host mutations, `pending_exec` / `pending_actions` for `call_host_api` / DQ create / payroll / leave submit |
| **Host UI** | My / Team / People ESS & admin (Plane A) — **primary write path** | Claiming Pulse Chat “submitted” when only My did |
| **Agent UI** | **Retired / off by default** (`pulseAgentUi.js`; debug: `carbon-ai-agent-ui=on`) | Shipping Agent toggle or DiscoveryComposer as default ESS surface |

## Do NOT

- Enable Confirm/Decline in Chat for host APIs because the banner says “Agent mode is OFF”.
- Teach Chat personas/system prompts to “CALL THE TOOL” for leave/loan/attendance/payroll/GOSI/onboarding.
- Re-enable Pulse Agent mode toggle / Clarifying “Plan now” for ESS without an explicit product decision.
- Ship one-line UI flips without a Pulse seat phase + G2 regression.

## DO

- Chat write-intent → honest handoff to **My** (or Team) only — no `open_panel` Agent CTA.
- Keep memory Chat-confirm as the sole Chat-write exception.
- Read: `.ai-toolkit/decisions/0046-pulse-chat-no-host-mutation-stage.md` · ADR-0014 · PB-62 · QA bank G2 / PC-090 / PC-091 / PC-350.
